                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.811/926: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-04-21T15:00:00+08:00">April 21, 1934—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received April 21—11:10 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>187. My 184, April 20, noon. British Legation states that British Foreign Office
                    has instructed it that it is unwilling to retreat from position previously taken
                    which was reported in my 122, March 15, 4 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
